# =========================================================================
# Emotional Intelligence Healer (EIH) — GitHub Copilot Context Isolation (.copilotignore)
# Prevents GitHub Copilot from indexing ephemeral reports, databases, and heavy fixtures.
# =========================================================================

# Virtual environments & dependencies
**/.venv/**
**/node_modules/**
**/.next/**

# Test artifacts & historical audit reports
**/test-results/**
**/playwright-report/**
**/reports/**
**/.coverage/**
**/htmlcov/**

# Large data and model dumps
**/clinical_memory_db/**
**/whisper_models/**
**/tests/data/**
**/tests/dom-map.md
**/tests/dom-audio-map.md

# Media & temp files
**/*.mp3
**/*.wav
**/*.webm
**/*.log
**/.tmp.*/**
**/scratch/**
